# E2E

## No fixed waits

Use condition-based assertions and waits. Do not use arbitrary delays such as `waitForTimeout` or `sleep`.

## Isolation

- Isolate test data and resources so specs pass in any order.
- Choose ports, workers, and fixtures based on the resources each test actually shares.

## Test shape

- Test behavior and accessible state. Use screenshots only when visual appearance is the behavior under test.
